   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Dear Yves, dear lavaan users,<p>maybe this a question better answered by someone from the semTools package. I want to use reliability(fit.object) in a multi-group case. But I&#39;ll get this error message:&quot;Error in coef[[1]]$tau : $ operator is invalid for atomic vectors&quot;<p>Single-group case works like a charm.<br>Has someone a solution or workaround (besides extracting all parameters and calculating the coefficient manually)?<p>Thanks in advance, kind regards,<br>Ulrich</p></p></p>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "91Ee3SxWAgAJ",
