   "date": "2015-12-24T09:00:00Z",
   "subject": "Re: Reliability in multi-group case",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I looked into the code on GitHub, here: <a href=\"https://github.com/simsem/semTools/blob/master/semTools/R/reliability.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/simsem/semTools/blob/master/semTools/R/reliability.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792429092963000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1laEtMeTb7jwBfU4xwBhG5\">https://github.com/simsem/semTools/blob/master/semTools/R/reliability.R</a><div>IMHO in line 185 the code should be (analogous to the single-group case) </div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">targettaunames</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> rownames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">coef</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">$</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">tau</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div>rather than</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">targettaunames</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> rownames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">coef</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">$</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">tau</span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Consolas,&#39;Liberation Mono&#39;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16.8px;white-space:pre;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div>Kind regards,</div><div>Ulrich</div></div>"
