    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>Am Donnerstag, 24. Dezember 2015 00:45:52 UTC+1 schrieb Ulrich Schroeders:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">Dear Yves, dear lavaan users,<p>maybe this a question better answered by someone from the semTools package. I want to use reliability(fit.object) in a multi-group case. But I&#39;ll get this error message:&quot;Error in coef[[1]]$tau : $ operator is invalid for atomic vectors&quot;</p><p>Single-group case works like a charm.<br>Has someone a solution or workaround (besides extracting all parameters and calculating the coefficient manually)?</p><p>Thanks in advance, kind regards,<br>Ulrich</p><p></p><p></p></blockquote></div></div>"
